msgid "What you hear"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In dev mode, you learn what your application does by looking: at the "
"terminal, at the browser, at the Dev UI.\n"
"https://github.com/quarkiverse/quarkus-sonify[Quarkus Sonify] lets you "
"listen instead."
msgstr ""

msgid "It is a small extension, and it is mostly for fun."
msgstr ""

msgid "Sonify plays a short sound on the machine that runs the application:"
msgstr ""

msgid "one when an HTTP request arrives, different for each HTTP method"
msgstr ""

msgid "one when its response is sent, different for each status code"
msgstr ""

msgid "a chime when the application starts, and after every live reload"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A `GET` is one tap, a `POST` is two rising taps, and a `DELETE` is two "
"falling taps.\n"
"For a response, the class of the status code picks the kind of sound, and "
"the code picks its pitch: a `200` is a clear note, a `404` is a hollow one, "
"and a `500` is a thud."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The sounds are synthesized in the JVM, so there is no browser tab to keep "
"open and no native dependency."
msgstr ""

msgid "Try it"
msgstr ""

msgid "Add the extension to your application:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Start dev mode, and send a request:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Your own sounds"
msgstr ""

msgid "A method of a CDI bean can have a sound of its own:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can also inject a `SoundPlayer` and call `play(\"order-placed\")` from "
"anywhere."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Every sound can be replaced with a WAV file or turned off in `application."
"properties`:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Only in dev mode"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Everything that makes a sound lives in an artifact that Quarkus only adds in "
"dev mode.\n"
"In production and in tests, the annotation and the `SoundPlayer` do nothing, "
"and the audio code is not part of the application.\n"
"There is nothing to remove before you ship."
msgstr ""

msgid "Listen for yourself"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The https://github.com/quarkiverse/quarkus-sonify[repository] has a demo "
"with a page of links, one for every HTTP method and status code.\n"
"Ideas for sounds are welcome in the https://github.com/quarkiverse/quarkus-"
"sonify/issues[issue tracker]."
msgstr ""
